{"prefectureId":"32","cities":{"32201":[{"id":"32201:national:57d3492dc9ee","cityId":"32201","category":"文化・名所","text":"「安部谷古墳」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2180"},{"id":"32201:national:50fc26f2f7f9","cityId":"32201","category":"地域","text":"松江市は、島根県の出雲地方に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9D%BE%E6%B1%9F%E5%B8%82&oldid=111422132"}],"32202":[{"id":"32202:national:be4121a1bb98","cityId":"32202","category":"地域","text":"浜田市は、島根県の西部、石見地方にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B5%9C%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82&oldid=111216527"}],"32203":[{"id":"32203:national:ff199ff0ca93","cityId":"32203","category":"文化・名所","text":"「上島古墳」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2213"}],"32204":[{"id":"32204:national:f6b4cd642295","cityId":"32204","category":"文化・名所","text":"「医光寺庭園」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2165"},{"id":"32204:national:a2a1fdf723cc","cityId":"32204","category":"地域","text":"益田市は、島根県の西部（石見地域）に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%9B%8A%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82&oldid=111216482"}],"32205":[{"id":"32205:national:b7725c780873","cityId":"32205","category":"歴史","text":"大田市の大半は、旧安濃郡と旧邇摩郡です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82&oldid=111216553"},{"id":"32205:national:e696435f04bf","cityId":"32205","category":"地域","text":"大田市は、島根県のほぼ中央部にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%B0%E5%B8%82&oldid=111216553"}],"32206":[{"id":"32206:national:0d9cc96d789a","cityId":"32206","category":"文化・名所","text":"「荒島古墳群」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/2190"},{"id":"32206:national:c55e62f04981","cityId":"32206","category":"地理・自然","text":"安来市は島根県の東端に位置し、鳥取県と県境です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%89%E6%9D%A5%E5%B8%82&oldid=111295646"},{"id":"32206:national:f5d0bff4c96a",